A provider skipped for its spent quota is a search that failed, not one
that never happened (\url{https://github.com/dbosk/scholar/issues/165}):
the session records it with the reason and the reset time, the search
output says so, and a later skip does not erase an earlier answer.  The
quota state is the real persisted limiter state, set as a spent quota
would set it.

<<test functions>>=
class TestSkippedProviderRecorded:
