We define the configuration details for each provider.
\label{sec:provider-config-reference}
This information is kept here rather than in the provider classes because
it is user-facing documentation, not implementation details.
The Web of Science entry lists its two alternative variables on separate
lines with a lone \enquote{or} between them: its column is [[no_wrap]],
so line breaks are the cell's own responsibility, one name per line is
what keeps each name copyable, and the widest \emph{line} (not the whole
cell) is what sizes the column.

