An agent decision without a reason is recorded, with the warning, and
a later machine decision replaces the reason: with a new one, or with
none when it gives none.  [[--keep-trace]] keeps the classifier's call
but not the earlier agent's reason.  A human's later decision keeps it,
as it keeps the classifier's.

