[[sessions relabel]] corrects the source and nothing else
(\cref{sec:relabel-source} in the review module), so the reason stays
with the decision it explains.  [[sessions reset]] sets the decision
back to pending and clears the fields, since no verdict is left for
the reason to explain, but keeps them in the reset's history ([[trace]],
which holds every field of [[MACHINE_AUDIT_FIELDS]] that was set,
\cref{sec:reset-decision} in the review module), so the earlier
screen's reason is not lost.  The help states the limit that the
review module sets, and a test keeps the two equal.

