Selection follows relabel's: every decision of a selected paper, in
session order, all missing selectors named in one run.  Of the
selected decisions, those with a [[--source]] source (all, without
[[--source]]) that are decided are the ones to reset; with explicit
selectors the others are named, with what they hold.

