The copies are found once for all papers ([[possible_twins]]), since
[[possible_copies]] goes through the whole session.  A foldable pair
names its other copy either way round; a possible copy, which
[[possible_copies]] lists by its DOI-less decision, names the DOI
decisions of its work key, and a DOI paper names the possible copies
of its key.

