\subsection{Papers left pending by the classifier}

When the session's vocabulary holds audit categories, the classifier
withholds the decision of a paper whose answer still lacks exactly one
category after its retry (\cref{sec:classifier-categories} in the LLM
review module), or whose category does not fit its decision, such as a
discard under [[supports-claim]] (\cref{sec:category-fits-status}). The paper silently staying pending would look like a
paper the batch never reached, so the run ends with a warning that
names each one and says what was wrong; the reviewer can then decide
it with [[sessions decide]] or leave it for the next batch.

<<report papers left pending by the classifier>>=
print_withheld_papers(console, session, result.withheld)
<<llm command>>=
def print_withheld_papers(console, session, withheld: list) -> None:
    """List the papers the classifier left pending, grouped by reason."""
    from scholar.notes import get_paper_id

    titles = {
        get_paper_id(d.paper): d.paper.title for d in session.decisions
    }
    for heading, withheld_here in (
        ("no usable answer", [d for d in withheld if d.answer_problem]),
        ("no single category that fits the decision",
         [d for d in withheld if not d.answer_problem]),
    ):
        if not withheld_here:
            continue
        console.print(
            f"[yellow]Left pending, {heading} "
            f"({len(withheld_here)}):[/yellow]"
        )
        for decision in withheld_here:
            title = titles.get(decision.paper_id, decision.paper_id)
            console.print(
                f"  {escape(title)} [dim]({escape(decision.paper_id)}: "
                f"{escape(decision.problem)})[/dim]"
            )
