The key change of \cref{ch:output-formatting} must not strand provenance
recorded under an old key.  A [[.bib]] written by an earlier version keys a
surname-first author by the given name ([[john2024]]); its block is imported,
and exported into a [[.bib]] the current formatter writes for the same paper
([[smith2024]]).  The paper has no DOI, so the two entries meet only through
the title-and-author hash of [[Paper.id]], the harder of the two matches.  The
block arrives, headed by the new key:

