Completion takes both routes.
Completing the first word lists the placeholders, so it imports nothing;
completing the word after [[snowball]] descends into the real command and
lists its subcommands.
Click reads the request from environment variables named after the program:
[[_SCHOLAR_COMPLETE]], and [[COMP_WORDS]] and [[COMP_CWORD]] for bash.

